REPORT zmk_simple1.

PARAMETERS: p_vbtyp TYPE vbak-vbtyp.

START-OF-SELECTION.

  SELECT * FROM ZMK_CDS_SIMPLE1( p_vbtyp = @p_vbtyp )
    INTO TABLE @DATA(LT_DATA).
   " WHERE vbtyp = @p_vbtyp.

    IF LT_DATA IS NOT INITIAL.
      CL_DEMO_OUTPUT=>display( LT_DATA ).

    ENDIF.